":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"GetSharedMemo resolves a supplied share token and proceeds through token, memo, authorization, and response construction stages.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":186}]},{"id":"f-principal","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler does not require authentication before resolving the share token; the anonymous viewer is handled while building the memo read context.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":170,"endLine":173},{"sourceId":"src-69d26d731760c05a","startLine":15,"endLine":29}]},{"id":"f-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The share resolves to its stored memo ID, and the handler retrieves that exact memo; no separate requested memo identity participates in this operation.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":178,"endLine":184}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"For a structurally valid memo, a share applies only when the shared memo ID equals the memo ID and the memo is not SPACE; that branch grants the private read class.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-da9fb2a209342c1f","startLine":87,"endLine":121}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The token is accepted only when the share lookup returns a share and its defined expiry has not passed; otherwise the source returns NOT_FOUND.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":216,"endLine":229}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After an allowed read, the handler converts and returns the memo, clears its parent, and states that the share grants access only to this memo rather than its surrounding graph.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":186,"endLine":213}]},{"id":"f-failure","kind":"effect","statement":"Missing, non-active, or SPACE memo state, and failed memo-read authorization, are mapped to NOT_FOUND rather than a returned memo.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-ba5b8420bf39f2db","startLine":182,"endLine":188}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["Whether getActiveMemoShare finds a share for the supplied token.","Whether the resolved share is unexpired at evaluation time."],"suggestedObservations":["Observe the result of the memo-share lookup for the supplied token, including whether it returns a share.","If a share is returned with an expiry, observe the current time relative to that expiry; an absent expiry is not expired by this check."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":447,"output":1059,"cacheRead":10624,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":52967.771299999906,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-28T18:28:58.573Z"}}
